      "config": {
        "displaySettings": {},
        "isSupportCustomProperty": false,
        "supportCustomProperty": false,
        "name": "Suite Navigation Menu",
        "description": "Global navigation across the Connected Experience suite.",
        "theme": "newSolidDarkBlue",
        "interval": 15,
        "type": "text",
        "timescale": "day",
        "version": 2,
        "content": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:#0b1220;color:#e5e7eb;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;color:#f8fafc;\">SmartAdmin Connected Experience \u2014 Navigation</div>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:6px;\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_00}}\" style=\"color:#e5e7eb;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\">Home</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:4px;\">00 - Home / Introductory</div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_01}}\" style=\"color:#e5e7eb;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\">Platform Value</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:4px;\">01 - Platform Value Overview</div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_02}}\" style=\"color:#e5e7eb;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\">Environment</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:4px;\">02 - Environment Health</div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_03}}\" style=\"color:#e5e7eb;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\">Alerts</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:4px;\">03 - Alert Overview</div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_04}}\" style=\"color:#e5e7eb;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\">Coverage</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:4px;\">04 - Coverage, Capacity &amp; Licenses</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_05}}\" style=\"color:#e5e7eb;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\">Websites</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:4px;\">05 - Websites and Services</div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_06}}\" style=\"color:#e5e7eb;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\">Admin</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:4px;\">06 - Access and Administration</div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_07}}\" style=\"color:#e5e7eb;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\">Collectors</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:4px;\">07 - Collector Health</div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#0ea5e9;border:1px solid #38bdf8;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.04em;margin-bottom:4px;\">CURRENT</div><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_08}}\" style=\"color:#0b1220;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\">Modules</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:4px;\">08 - LogicModule and Content</div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_09}}\" style=\"color:#e5e7eb;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\">Adoption</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:4px;\">09 - Adoption and Optimization</div></td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:6px;\">After import, replace {{PORTAL_BASE}} and {{DASHBOARD_ID_NN}} placeholders. Metrics work even before links are configured.</div>\n</div>"
      }
    },
    {
      "position": {
        "col": 1,
        "sizex": 12,
        "row": 4,
        "sizey": 5
      },
      "config": {
        "displaySettings": {},
        "isSupportCustomProperty": false,
        "supportCustomProperty": false,
        "name": "LogicModule and Content \u2014 Read First",
        "description": "Read first guide for this dashboard.",
        "theme": "newSolidDarkBlue",
        "interval": 15,
        "type": "text",
        "timescale": "day",
        "version": 2,
        "content": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.45;background:#0f172a;color:#e5e7eb;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:14px;padding:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#f9fafb;margin-bottom:4px;\">LogicModule and Content</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#9ca3af;margin-bottom:12px;\">Content inventory plus noisy modules. Decorative duplicate headers from the source pack were replaced by this guide.</div>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:10px;\"><tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;width:33%;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Questions this dashboard answers</div>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:12px;\"><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">What LogicModules are installed by type?</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Which modules alert most over 90 days?</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Which datasources have the most instances?</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;width:34%;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Recommended review flow</div>\n<ol style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:12px;\"><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><strong>Inventory scorecards</strong> \u2014 Counts by type</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><strong>90-day alert tables</strong> \u2014 Noise</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><strong>Instance count table</strong> \u2014 Footprint</li></ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;width:33%;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Where to go next</div>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:12px;\"><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Alert Overview \u2014 03</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Adoption \u2014 09</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Coverage \u2014 04</li></ul>\n<div style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;\">Empty / zero: confirm tokens and LogicModules. Healthy zero critical alerts still warrants Warning and dead-resource checks.</div>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n</div>"
      }
    },
